---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Tell us about your sales team, your sales cycle, and where the deal record breaks. Apply for the Klozdesk design-partner pilot."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <Eyebrow>Contact</Eyebrow>
      <h1>Tell us about the deal <em>that keeps slipping.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        We are onboarding a small pilot cohort of Nigerian solar and EPC sales teams. Tell us
        about your team, your sales cycle, and where the record breaks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell contact-grid">
      <div data-reveal>
        <Eyebrow>What to include</Eyebrow>
        <h2>A short note is <em>enough.</em></h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Team size and number of customer-facing reps.</li>
          <li>Average deal size and typical sales cycle.</li>
          <li>Where the conversation happens: voice notes, WhatsApp, email, site visits.</li>
          <li>The CRM you use today—or the spreadsheet doing the job.</li>
          <li>The handoff that hurts most: missed follow-up, stale stage, lost context.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="callout mt-2">
          We are a small team. If we are not a fit, we will say so—and point you somewhere better
          if we can.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="email-card">
          <Eyebrow tone="paper">Start here</Eyebrow>
          <h2>One email. <em>No form maze.</em></h2>
          <a class="email" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Klozdesk%20pilot%20inquiry`}>
            {site.email}
          </a>
          <br />
          <button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy={site.email}>
            Copy email
          </button>
          <p class="small">
            We aim to reply within two business days. If you prefer, include a phone number and a
            good time to talk.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper-2">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <Eyebrow>What happens next</Eyebrow>
          <h2>Three steps. <em>No pressure.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede">
          We would rather disqualify a bad fit early than sell a pilot that cannot work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pilot-grid" data-reveal>
        <article class="pilot-card">
          <span class="pilot-card__num">01</span>
          <h3>A 20-minute conversation</h3>
          <p>We ask about the deal, the team, and the record. You ask us anything.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pilot-card">
          <span class="pilot-card__num">02</span>
          <h3>A fit check</h3>
          <p>We confirm whether the workflow, channels, and timing are a real match.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pilot-card">
          <span class="pilot-card__num">03</span>
          <h3>A written pilot scope</h3>
          <p>One team, one workflow, six weeks, a fixed fee, and a clear exit.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const copyButton = document.querySelector('[data-copy]');

  copyButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const email = copyButton.getAttribute('data-copy') ?? '';
    const original = copyButton.textContent ?? 'Copy email';

    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(email);
      copyButton.textContent = 'Copied';
      window.setTimeout(() => {
        copyButton.textContent = original;
      }, 1800);
    } catch {
      window.location.href = `mailto:${email}`;
    }
  });
</script>
